  "description": "Distributed rate-limit store (IRateLimitStore) for ConduitSharp over the Redis protocol\n      (RESP) — works with Valkey, Redis 7, and any RESP-compatible server. Shares fixed-window\n      counters across gateway replicas instead of each instance counting independently. Fails\n      open: a backend outage degrades to allowing requests rather than taking down the gateway.",
